+# v3 design-change checklist
+
+All 61 recommendations from the preceding frontend review are implemented below. Where the review offered alternatives, this records the chosen MVP-sized treatment rather than introducing every alternative. No mobile redesign, UI library, custom Transformer handles, storage, or generic editor framework was added.
+
+Paths abbreviate `src/components/`, `src/styles.css`, and `src/ui/presentation.ts`. Detailed verification and limitations are in `REVIEW-v3.md`.
+
+| # | Review topic | Implemented treatment | Main location |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| 1 | Canvas priority | 48px header; 52px desktop settings; 44px selection toolbar; 32px footer; narrower sidebars. | styles.css |
+| 2 | Editorial branding | Removed floral logo, serif treatments, slogan, and decorative empty-state emblem. System sans-serif throughout. | App; Workspace; styles |
+| 3 | Legibility | 12–13px primary UI, 11px metadata, 10px only tertiary selection caption; no 8–9px UI text. | styles |
+| 4 | Color system | Neutral surface/text/border tokens; one blue focus/selection/export accent; semantic warning/error states. | styles; ui/presentation |
+| 5 | Horizontal hierarchy | History and Demo in compact application bar; cell/repeat/background/Fit/Inspect together below; contextual selection row belongs to canvas. | App; CellControls |
+| 6 | Contextual toolbar | No selection shows a short instruction instead of six disabled action buttons. | SelectionToolbar |
+| 7 | Explicit groups | Separate duplicate, flip, stack, and delete groups; no nth-child spacing logic for actions. | SelectionToolbar; styles |
+| 8 | Desktop adaptation | 900px minimum width; responsive sidebar widths; narrow settings wrap by group; panels scroll independently. | styles |
+| 9 | Session messaging | One persistent Local session / Refresh clears work message; removed duplicate footer/marketing status. | App; AssetTray |
+| 10 | Demo hierarchy | Subordinate text action in header and task-oriented empty-state CTA, not a primary action. | App; Workspace |
+| 11 | Dimension capacity | 56px numeric fields fit four digits without cramped units. | CellControls; styles |
+| 12 | Compact dimensions | W/H pair with shared px label and accessible individual names. | CellControls |
+| 13 | Background grouping | One labeled group combines swatch, optional hex value, and Transparent; swatch is disabled while transparent. | CellControls |
+| 14 | Repeat diagrams | 20px diagrams use 6px cells and visible 4px stagger offsets; text labels remain. | styles |
+| 15 | Narrow labels | Cell, Repeat, and Background labels stay visible; wrap groups rather than removing labels. | styles |
+| 16 | Import footprint | Large empty drop target collapses to a 36px Add PNGs target after first import. | AssetTray; styles |
+| 17 | Placement affordance | Whole source row places image; descriptive accessible label, border hover, and plus at wider widths; removed zoom animation. | AssetTray; styles |
+| 18 | Source rows | One-column thumbnail/name/native-dimensions list replaces cramped two-column cards. | AssetTray; styles |
+| 19 | Asset empty state | Removed decorative stitches; No source images plus direct import/demo instruction. | AssetTray |
+| 20 | Placement stack | Dense rows, readable metadata, tabular numbers, distinct hover and selected 2px accent edge. | AssetTray; styles |
+| 21 | Stack direction | Visible Topmost first caption describes both order and obscured-item selection. | AssetTray |
+| 22 | Ambiguous numbering | Removed unlabeled stack/index numbers. Array stacking behavior is unchanged. | AssetTray |
+| 23 | Canvas label | Removed always-true LIVE REPEAT overlay. | Workspace |
+| 24 | Cell outline | Neutral gray origin-cell outline instead of selection accent. | Workspace; ui/presentation |
+| 25 | Origin label | 11px screen-equivalent label with neutral color, not zoom-shrinking text. | Workspace |
+| 26 | Transformer acquisition | 11px native corner anchors; native rotation anchor has distinct rounded, filled styling. No custom handles. | Workspace |
+| 27 | Selected identity | Selected source name appears in canvas toolbar with ellipsis and full-name title. | SelectionToolbar |
+| 28 | Action discoverability | Visible Flip H/V and Front/Back labels; compact H/V on narrow canvas; accessible names and native titles retained for icon actions. | SelectionToolbar |
+| 29 | Destructive action | Delete has red hover/focus treatment rather than identical action styling. | SelectionToolbar; styles |
+| 30 | Pan feedback | Footer switches to Panning while Space is held; grab/grabbing cursors remain. | Workspace |
+| 31 | Copy budget status | Zoom is primary; copy count is subdued and gets warning emphasis at 90% of render cap. | Workspace; styles |
+| 32 | Shortcut hints | Selection switches footer to nudge/Shift-step hints; wider canvas adds duplicate/delete; no selection shows pan/zoom. | Workspace |
+| 33 | Canvas empty state | No placements yet, exact source-click instruction, and Add demo CTA. | Workspace |
+| 34 | Neutral empty canvas | Removed beige overlay; initial document background is white; transparency checker remains. | Workspace; types; styles |
+| 35 | Right-panel architecture | Separated Inspector, Export, and PNG verification with task headings and borders. | Inspector; OutputPanel; ProofPanel |
+| 36 | Inspector priority | Selection data precedes export and proof. | OutputPanel |
+| 37 | Output numerals | 18px semibold system sans-serif with tabular numerals, no Georgia. | styles |
+| 38 | Technical diagram | Small rectangle diagram communicates baked tile structure without decorative shadow. | OutputPanel; styles |
+| 39 | Diagram clutter | Removed tiny 0,0 origin annotation. | OutputPanel |
+| 40 | Primary action | Export PNG is the single filled primary action. | OutputPanel; styles |
+| 41 | Progress semantics | Rendering label and aria-busy depend only on export state, not gesture lock; busy button remains visible at 80% opacity. | App; OutputPanel; styles |
+| 42 | Stale proof | Prominent OUT OF DATE badge and explicit edits-not-included status. | ProofPanel; styles |
+| 43 | Proof purpose | PNG verification heading and same-download explanation distinguish proof from live scene. | ProofPanel |
+| 44 | Pixel disclaimer | Readable pixels-only / no DPI-CMYK settings note; no unsupported claim about encoder metadata. | OutputPanel; styles |
+| 45 | Upscale feedback | Global count of placements exceeding native size plus warning for selected enlarged placement. | Inspector; OutputPanel |
+| 46 | Inspector typography | 11px labels, 12px tabular values; values visually outrank labels. | Inspector; styles |
+| 47 | Flip state | Explicit Not flipped, H flipped, V flipped, or H + V flipped in Inspector; placement rows show actual orientation. | Inspector; AssetTray; ui/presentation |
+| 48 | Precise linkage copy | Editing any repeat copy updates this placement. | Inspector |
+| 49 | Focus coverage | Visible focus covers buttons, inputs, selects, textareas, and focusable workspace. | styles |
+| 50 | Native checkbox | 16px native checkbox with consistent accent and focus styling; no custom checkbox component. | styles |
+| 51 | Hover semantics | Neutral toolbar hover, local segmented state, border source hover, red destructive state, distinct primary hover. | styles |
+| 52 | Disabled visibility | Ordinary disabled buttons at 50%; active export at 80%. | styles |
+| 53 | Click targets | 32px minimum action buttons across widths; no 28px toolbar shrinking. | styles |
+| 54 | Constrained errors | Canvas message limited to 440px and available bounds rather than a full-width artwork slab. | Workspace; styles |
+| 55 | Recovery hierarchy | Heading/message/action/close structure; Fit view appears only after count-aware preflight; active render guard stays visible until resolved. | Workspace |
+| 56 | Import validation | Neutral, filename-first errors in source section; readable text and dismiss control; valid sources remain reachable by scrolling. | AssetTray; styles |
+| 57 | Spacing | Shared 4/8/12/16/24px spacing tokens; small optical/diagram offsets are explicit exceptions. | styles |
+| 58 | Radii | 4px controls and 6px panels; native anchors and tiny swatch inset retain purposeful geometry. | styles |
+| 59 | Shadows | Removed decorative drop/segment/diagram shadows; borders and surfaces establish separation. | styles |
+| 60 | Task language | Removed marketing headlines and metaphors in favor of direct import/place/edit/export instructions. | App; AssetTray; Workspace; Inspector |
+| 61 | Terminology | Source image = PNG; placement = independent transform; repeat copy = derived lattice image; tile = exported rectangle. | UI copy; README |
+
+## Functional safeguards accompanying the styling
+
+The previous camera-recovery correction remains intact. New UI state does not enter document history. Native-image import, transforms, enumeration, stacking, undo/redo, and isolated PNG rendering are unchanged. Busy gestures cannot claim an export is rendering. Proof state is keyed to the exact exported Blob; older success state is never reused for a pending or failed new decode. Narrow layouts preserve settings labels, proof aspect ratio, and scroll access to valid imports.
+
+The static Chromium evidence validates layout/CSS only. The complete React/Konva app and its authored browser tests remain unverified because npm dependency installation was blocked. No generated lockfile or production build is included.
